---
title: Introduction
description: What this design system is and how it's put together.
order: 0
---

design-system-ui is a small design system built on top of [shadcn-svelte](https://www.shadcn-svelte.com), documented alongside a live component registry.

Every component, block, and utility in this site is backed by a real file in the `registry/items` folder — the same source used to render its live preview, its Storybook story, and (eventually) its CLI-installable JSON payload.

## What's here today

- **Docs** — installation, styling, and theming guides.
- **Components** — small, composable UI primitives.
- **Blocks** — larger compositions built from components.
- **Utilities** — helpers and hooks shared across the system.

## What's coming later

CLI distribution via a hosted `registry.json`, full-text search, `llms.txt`/Markdown twins of every page, and multiple accent themes are planned for a later phase.
